Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/20] FreeChat: notifications only say there are new messages

A per-device setting, off by default: notifications are shown like with app
lock, a single 'new messages' notification without sender, room or content.
